\section*{Document Scope}

This document contains the clean, finalized versions of SAT.O modules 1 through 8. These constitute the structural, falsifiability-aligned core of the SAT.4D framework. All entries here are directive-compliant, legacy-independent, and declared within \textbf{Interpretive Mode 1 (True Block)}.

\section*{Included Modules}

